Wrong (B): There is no reduced AOTC rate for graduate studies; the AOTC is simply unavailable after four years of prior claims.
Wrong (C): The LLC maximum is $2,000 (20% of $10,000), not $2,500; and with only $8,000 in expenses, the credit is $1,600.$EXPL$
